DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-18 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin our children's librarians for this sp
 ecial 25-minute story time for babies and their caregivers. We’ll share 
 songs\, rhymes and books while helping to build baby’s early literacy an
 d social-emotional skills. For children birth to 18 months and their careg
 ivers. Space may be limited. School groups and daycares need to make speci
 al arrangements to attend story time. Please call the library or email sul
 zerkids@chipublib.org for more information. Accessibility Need sign langua
 ge interpretation o\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/ev
 ents/6a79ecdc1d5d03c3a6bba01d
LOCATION:Sulzer Regional\, 4455 N. Lincoln Ave.\, Chicago\, IL 60625
URL:https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/events/6a79ecdc1d5d03c3a6bba01d
