 \, and contributions of Latin America through music\, education\, and comm
 unity connection. Kick off the day with an energetic cultural performance 
 by La Escuelita Bombera de Corazón\, then explore our Community & Career 
 Fair featuring Field Museum staff and local organizations sharing educatio
 nal resources\, career pathways\, and opportunities to get involved. Desig
 ned with youth and families in mind\, this event welcomes Chicago-area mid
 dle and high school students\, educators\, and visitors of all ages to con
 nect with community partners\, discover future opportunities\, and celebra
 te Latin American heritage in a fun and engaging environment. 10:30am-11am
 : La Escuelita Bombera de Corazón performance 11-12pm: Community and Care
 er Fair Location: Stanley Field Hall This event is included with General A
 dmission\, which is free to Illinois residents on Wednesdays .\\n\\nMore i
 nfo: https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-events/cultural-programming/sigamos-a
 delante-community-and-career-fair
LOCATION:Field Museum\, 1400 S Lake Shore Dr\, Chicago\, IL 60605
