UID:bb3fe4e7529d77eb68697fab592b9987@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:museum,science,family,all_audiences
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Field Museum - Events\\nCost: Included with admissi
 on\\nAges: All ages\\nCategory: General\\n\\nWhat lies within the silky we
 bs of spiders? Join Thomas Marchese as he reveals a hidden world at an uni
 maginable scale through the use of a Scanning Electron Microscope (SEM). E
 xplore the micro-verse of spiders as Marchese showcases how this powerful 
 tool can be used to closely examine a spider web and uncover the mysteriou
 s contents trapped within it. Presented by Thomas S. Marchese\, NSF Gradua
 te Research Fellow at the University of Chicago's Pritzker School of Molec
 ular Engineering.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-events/m
 eet-a-scientist/meet-a-scientist-spooky-spider-webs
LOCATION:Field Museum\, 1400 S Lake Shore Dr\, Chicago\, IL 60605
URL:https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-events/meet-a-scientist/meet-a-scienti
 st-spooky-spider-webs
